00:08:58.255 --> 00:09:00.023
I THINK IT'S TIME FOR US TO

00:09:00.024 --> 00:09:00.990
THINK ABOUT HOW WE HANDLE THIS,

00:09:00.991 --> 00:09:04.894
BECAUSE WE ARE NOT THERE TO STAY

00:09:04.895 --> 00:09:05.228
FOREVER.

00:09:05.229 --> 00:09:06.829
&gt;&gt; I KNOW THESE ARE TWO

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:07.597
DIFFERENT THINGS, BUT WE'VE HAD

00:09:07.598 --> 00:09:10.134
